  "meta": {
    "name": "Lithic Choir Harmonic Chisel",
    "description": "Forged by the Deep-Bore Horologist, this fusion of a salt-tempered chisel, a cinder quill bell, and pewter gravel is a masterpiece of the Calcified Foundry. The Infinite Scriptorium of the Lithic Choir teaches that bedrock is frozen acoustic music. Reading its inscribed manual imparts cleaving wisdom, while equipping it causes zero-damage stalls to emit bell harmonics that shatter equal-depth contours in the loam.",
